<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Kohler talks continue, advises caution.</title>
<headline>Kohler talks continue, advises caution.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African packaging group Kohler Ltd said on Monday that talks were continuing which could have an effect on the company's share price.</p>
<p>Kohler advised shareholders to exercise caution in dealing in Kohler shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
